What Is the Wafer Mounting Machine Market?
Wafer mounting machines are specialized semiconductor manufacturing systems used to attach silicon wafers to adhesive films, tapes, or supporting frames before subsequent processing operations. These machines help stabilize wafers during processes such as grinding, dicing, and singulation.

The equipment is available in fully automatic, semi-automatic, and manual configurations. Its performance is important for maintaining wafer alignment, reducing air bubbles, preventing breakage, and supporting consistent processing quality. Increasing semiconductor production and demand for advanced wafer handling are contributing to market growth.

